    "body": "This is a normative change and therefore would normally require the PR template. I'm going to waive that requirement given that Chromium is supportive and is the only implementation so far (out of Chromium, Gecko, and WebKit) and we already have test coverage. It should also be non-controversial as this API is partially permission-gated and permissions shouldn't work without HTTPS.",
